Title: Scammed!
By: Bhaskar Bhattacharya

Characters:

Anirudh: Indian male about 26 year old

Entities: Unknown Humanoids

#Act 1 - The Setup

INT. ROOFTOP ROOM - EVENING

The scene opens with our main character taking a power nap on his desk. Mobile phone on his left.

His Mobile rings. He looks up and sees the caller ID: Supervisor sir

He jumps up, clears his throat and picks up the call.

SUPERVISOR
Hello! Anirudh, where are you? Tum abhi tak Clocked-in kyon nhi ho? 5:00 baje shift start hai na tumhara?

ANIRUDH
Hello, Yes sir. Mai bus Clock-in kar hi rha tha. Thoda late ho gaya sorry.

Starts fiddling with the PC

SUPERVISOR
Pehle hi din late join kar rhe ho? Majak chal rha hai kya yahan par?

ANIRUDH
Arre nhi nhi sir, kya baat kar rhe hain. Koi majak nhi chal rha.

SUPERVISOR
Fir mujhe kyon call karke tumko batana pad rha hai Clock-in karne ke liye?

ANIRUDH
Sir bus aaj bhar late hua hu. Aage se pakka nhi hoga.

SUPERVISOR
(Condesendingly)
Chalo, maan li tumhari baat. Waise aaj kaun se script par baithe ho?

ANIRUDH
Aaj mai NBI waale script par hu. And Token harvest karna hai, Marauder script use karke.

SUPERVISOR
Kitne total leads hain tumhare sheet par aaj?

ANIRUDH
Around 30 hai sir.

SUPERVISOR
Shaam ke 6:00 baj rhe hain. 20 Harvest chahiye aaj, 20 se 1 kam hua toh kal se doosra job dekh lena, theek hai?

ANIRUDH
Nhi nhi sir. Ho jaayega. Maine pehle bhi kiya hai. Toh mujhe confidence hai.

SUPERVISOR
Ye confidence hai ya overconfidence?

ANIRUDH
Confidence hi hai sir. Agar emotional log mil gayein toh jaldi hi ho jaayega.

SUPERVISOR
Chalo, ye bhi maan liya. Aur tumhare end se koi sawaal?

ANIRUDH
Nhi sir, mere end se sab sorted hai.

SUPERVISOR
Chalo fir shuru kar do. Muhrat nikla ja rha hai.

ANIRUDH
Ji, abhi start kar rha hu.

Call Disconnects. Anirudh curses under his breath. Then puts his phone down and Clocks-in. After that opens the CRM for the job.

Anirudh downloads a csv style file that lists targets for him for today.

ANIRUDH
Chaliye fer. Inspector sahab, ready ho jaayiye.

Anirudh says to himself as he cracks his fingers. Pick the first target in the list. Dials the number using the CRM tool. The call connects after a few seconds.

CALLEE
Hello?

ANIRUDH
Hello, main Inspector Vijaya bol rha hu National Bureau of Investigation ke Cybercrime Division se. Kya meri baat Mr. Sahaj Patel se ho rhi hai?

CALLEE
Ji mera naam hi Sahaj Patel hai.

ANIRUDH
Mr. Patel aap meri baat dhyaan se sunein aur call disconnect na karein. Isse pehle mai call ka reason bataun, mai aapse kuch basic details confirm karunga.

CALLEE
Hua kya hai bhai sahab?

ANIRUDH
Ye phone number 981000005 aapka hi personal number hai right?

CALLEE
Ji mera hi number hai ye.

ANIRUDH
Aapka address Ananda Vihaar, Noida ka hai.

CALLEE
Ji, par aap ye sab kyon mujhe bata rhe hain.

ANIRUDH
Patelji, ek investigation me ek overseas Bank account saamne aaya hai jisse ki aapka phone number aur PAN number linked hai. Aur-

CALLEE
(Voice raising)
Kya baat kar rhe hain? Kaun sa account? Mera koi overseas account nhi hai.

ANIRUDH
Sun toh lijiye poori baat. Humare records ke mutabik apka hi phone aur PAN number linked hai uss account se. And uspe 15 crore se jyada ke fraud transactions hue hain.

CALLEE
(Defensively)
Aise kaise maan le aapki baat. 15 crore koi majak hai? Itna bada amount aaj tak aaj tak dekha nhi humne, aap keh rhe hain mere account me hai?

ANIRUDH
Aapke inkaar karne se humare records nhi badal jaayenge Patelji. Filhaal toh investigation hoga uske baad hi pata chalega kitna doodh hai aur kitna paani.

CALLEE
Arre kya doodh paani kar rhe hain? Aap log aise kisi pe bhi, kuch bhi ilzaam laga denge? Koi system naam ki cheez hai ki nhi?

ANIRUDH
Dekhiye saara cheez system ke hisaab se hi hoga. Aapke naam ka Arrest Warrant issue hua hai jo aapke address pe Police lekar jaayegi. Uske baad poochtaach me aage ka khulaasa hoga. 

CALLEE
(Getting Agitated)
Aise kaise arrest kar sakte hain mujhe? Matlab account hoga kisi mantri ke bete ka, aur mujhe sirf bali ka bakra banaya ja rha hai. Mere paas bhi licensi revolver hai, goli maar denge jo bhi faaltu arrest karne aayega mujhe.

ANIRUDH
Patelji, Patelji aap apna hi maamla kharab kar rhe hain. Ye call record ho rhi hai, samjhe aap?

CALLEE
(Highly Agitated)
Aur kitna kharab hoga maamla. Agar jail jaayenge toh murder ke liye jaayenge. Kisi aise jurm ke liye nhi jo humne kiya hi nhi.

ANIRUDH
Shaant ho jaayiye pehle aap thoda. Aur suniye meri baat.

CALLEE
Arre kya shaant ho jaaye? Aap ghatiya ilzaam lagaye ja rhe hain mere upar.

ANIRUDH
Patelji fir aap bole ja rhe hain. Meri baat sun toh lijiye pehle. Agar aapko lagta hai ki aapki identity ka misuse hua toh aap cooperate kijiye humare saath. Hum secondary verification ka process shuru kar sakte hain.

CALLEE
Haan, hua hai misuse. Hum aapko dus baar bata chuke hain ki humara koi account nhi hai, jisme ye - 15 crore pada hai.

ANIRUDH
Patelji mai aapse request kar rha hu thoda thande dimaag se kaam lijiye abhi. Mai samajh rha hu identity ka misuse hua ho sakta hai.

CALLEE
Ho sakta nhi, hua hai. Aur dimaag aapne mera kharab kar rakha hai aur bol rhe hain shaant rahiye.

ANIRUDH
Patelji ab jyada ho rha hai. Mai aapko last oppertunity de rha hu, aap cooperate kijiye humare saath. Mai secondary verification ka request abhi bhi daal sakta hu.

CALLEE
Ji mai shaant hu. Bataiye kya karna hai.

Anirudh launches Marauder Script.

ANIRUDH
Aapka poora naam Sahaj Kumar Patel hai, right?

CALLEE
Ji, Sahaj Kumar Patel.

ANIRUDH
Theek hai. Apna Data of Birth ek baar bataiye mai record se match karunga.

CALLEE
28 March, 1965

ANIRUDH
Theek hai, ab mai aapka phone number verify karunga. Uske liye system ek verification code generate karega. Aapko woh code jor se padna hai taaki mai usko records ke saath match kara sakun. Samajh gaye aap?

CALLEE
Kaisa code?

Anirudh initiates Marauder Script

ANIRUDH
Dekhiye ek verification code aaya hoga aapke mobile pe.

CALLEE
Han, aaya abhi. Six Four Seven One One Five

ANIRUDH
Ji ek minute.

Anirudh enters the code in the "Context Data" input field of Marauder Script and hits "Submit".

ANIRUDH
Ji dhanyawaad Patelji. Aapke records theek dikh rhe hain. Maine secondary verification ke liye application daal diya hai. Aur abhi ke liye aapka Warrant wapas liya ja rha hai.

CALLEE
Abhi ke liye matlab? Parmanent wapas hona chahiye na?

ANIRUDH
Parmanent wapas ho jaayega ek baar verification ka process poora hone dijiye. Aur abhi kyonki investigation ongoing hai toh aapka number surveillance pe rahega. Isiliye aapke safety ke liye best rahega aap apna phone switch off kar dijiye. Samajh rhe hain aap?

CALLEE
Humare cooperation ke bawajood surveillance kyon?

ANIRUDH
Dekhiye ye SOP hai, investigation ke dauraan sirf surveillance rehta hai. Filhaal aapse itna hi share kar sakta hu. Baaki case confidential hai toh abhi iske baare me kisi se bhi discuss mat kijiyega. Verification poora hone ke baad aapko ek Clearance Letter receive ho jaayega aapke address par.

CALLEE
Woh sab toh theek hai but mujhe lag rha hai kuch toh gadbad hai.

ANIRUDH
Gadbad tha ab sab theek ho jaayega. Abhi aap phone rakhiye aur switch off kar dijiye. Samajh gaye aap?

CALLEE
Baat kuch hajam nhi ho rha hai mujhe.

ANIRUDH
Ho jaayega hajam. Aapka aur time nhi lunga, isiliye shubh raatri.

CALLEE
Chaliye dekhte hain.

Satisfied. Anirudh hangs up. Marks lead as "Harvest Complete". Celebrates quietly. And looks at the next lead.

He checks the number and enters it in the Dialer. Pauses for a second. Takes a deep breath and hits Dial.

CALLEE
Hello?

ANIRUDH
Hello, main Inspector Vijaya bol rha hu National Bureau of Investigation ke Cybercrime Division se. Kya meri baat Mr. Gopiraj se ho rhi hai?

CALLEE
Ji nhi, mai unka deta bol rha hu. Kya chahiye aapko?

ANIRUDH
Gopiraj ji ko phone dijiyega mujhe unse hi baat karni hai.

CALLEE
(Sternly)
Ye toh nhi ho sakta bhai sahab. Pitaji abhi busy hain. Aap mujhse hi baat kijiye na.

ANIRUDH
Accha? Jinse baat ho rhi hai unka naam?

CALLEE
Aapki baat desh ke Pradhaan Mantri se ho rhi hai. Humara naam aapko Google pe mil jaayega.

ANIRUDH
(Getting Annoyed)
1 min. Kya tareeka hai ye baat karne ka? Tumhaare pitaji jail ja sakte hain aur tumko mazak soojh rha hai?

CALLEE
Han kya? Kis khushi me woh jail ja sakte hain jara hume bhi bataiye.

ANIRUDH
Beta shayad tum nhi samjhe. Hum NBI, Cybercrime Division se Inspector Vijaya bol rhe hain. Hume tumhare pitaji se urgently baat karni ek case ke regarding.

CALLEE
Nhi Inspector ji aap nhi samjhe. Mujhe bohot acche se pata hai aap kaun bol rhe hain. Waise toh mujhe shauk nhi hai apna time waste karne ka, lekin aapne toh suspense bana diya. Ab toh mujhe janna hai ki kaun se case ke baare me aapko papa se baat karna hai.

ANIRUDH
Case details mai tumhaare saath nhi share kar sakta. Lekin behtar yeh hoga apna papa se meri baat kara do. Nhi toh tumhaare liye bhi problem ho sakta hai.

CALLEE
Phone toh nhi de rha mai Papa ko. Baaki hum bhi thoda jaane kya problem hoga.

ANIRUDH
(Annoyed)
Kya problem hoga jaanna hai na? Theek hai, Ek sensitive investigation me cooperate na karna bhi ek jurm hai. Mai tumhaare against ek warrant issue karwata hu, chalega?

CALLEE
(Laughs loudly)
Accha? Aukaat hai itna tumhaare paas jo warrant issue karega? Arre hai toh laga Aatankwaad ka case! Tab jaanu tu hai koi NBI waala.

ANIRUDH
(Furious)
Ruk tujhe toh batana padega. Tu aise nhi maane ga na? Tere aur tere baap ke, dono ke naam pe Arrest Warrant issue karwata hu. Fir lockup me milenge aur dekhenge tujhe tab bhi hasi aati hai ya nhi.

CALLEE
(Laughing)
Hah! Maza hi aa gaya. Maere against arrest waarant issue ho gaya, kyon ki mujhe hasi bohot aati hai!

ANIRUDH
Abhi toh aur hasi aayegi. Tu ruk, tere naam pe jitne cases milte hain na, sab kholta hu mai. Tu dekh bus.

CALLEE
Aur tere naam pe Only Fans kholta hu mai. Tu toh 20 Rs me hi mujra dikha dega.

ANIRUDH
(Very angry)
Tu Government officer ke saath battameezi kar rha hai na. Kya kya hoga tere saath tujhe abhi samajh me nhi aa rha hai.

CALLEE
Arre ja jo ukhaarna hai ukhaar le. Koi government officer nhi hai tu. Bohot dekhe hain tere jaise.

ANIRUDH
Kya dekha hai be? Aaja mere ghar pe aur bohot kuch dikhata hu tujhe.

CALLEE
Aa gaya na apne asli aukaat pe? Arre kya gunda banega re tu?

ANIRUDH
Tujhe bhare bazaar me aisa nachunga tu abhi jaanta nhi hai mujhe.

CALLEE
Haan tera baap naachta hai na bazaar me?

ANIRUDH
Baap pe mat ja, bohot galat ho jaayega tere saath, bata rha hu.

CALLEE
Arre ja re, itna phokat ka time nhi hai mere paas. Bada aaya.

ANIRUDH
Ruk batata hu tujhe-

Call disconnects abruptly cutting Anirudh off. He mutters something to himself angrily while shaking his fist. Silence for few seconds.

Suddenly there is a loud thud outside his room. He is startled. He grabs a stick and his mobile. Turns on flashlight and goes outside his room. There is a wooden chair outside which has toppled. He goes outside and sits it up again. The chair now casts a shadow into the room through the door.

He relaxes and then returns to his workstation to mark the lead as failed. Checks another lead and hesitates for some time. Then he takes a deep breath and starts calling the numbers. CALL MONTAGE BEGINS.


INT. rooftop room - Late evening


Anirudh looks at the Sheet and the next person is named as Mahutila Surashendu, note beside his name says: Ex-Diplomat, High Value Target, Refer Doc-13 for more intel. Anirudh opens Doc-13 and it has some information like: Possible off-shore accounts. Previously booked for unverified money transfers, released due to lack of evidence. Associated with with Sleeper blocks and was investigated under UAPA, results inconclusive. Mention of term Outpost-225 in several old intelligence reports. No information regarding what that is.

After reading the doc he checks the number. His number is 112005116. 

ANIRUDH
Ab ye kaisa number hai?

He asks himself as he dials it. Call connects after few seconds.

CALLEE
Hello

ANIRUDH
Hello, main Inspector Vijaya bol rha hu National Bureau of Investigation ke Cybercrime Division se. Kya meri baat Mr. uh-Mahutila se ho rhi hai?

CALLEE
Um yes but-mujhse kya kaam hai aapko?

ANIRUDH
Mahutilaji mai investigating officer hu ek case file pe, aapke naam ka ek previous case file reopen hua hai, plus kuch naye leads hain jo aapko link karte hain kuch off-shore bank accounts se.

CALLEE
Inspector sahab aap logon ka kya ye favourite time pass hai? Har kuch saalon me aaplog ek baseless allegation leke aa jaate hain mere darwaaze pe.

ANIRUDH
Dekhiye baseless hai ki nhi ye toh investigation ke baad hi pata chalega. Filhaal ek primary investigation karna mera kaam hai.

CALLEE
Mr. Jo bhi naam hai aapka. I used to be a Diplomat. Aise call pe kaun si government agency call karke threaten karti hai? You think I am an idiot?

ANIRUDH
Careful Mr. Mahutila, humare paas solid intel hain aapke against. Humein underestimate karne ki galti mat kijiyega.

CALLEE
Nonsense! Kuch nhi hai aapke paas. Aur agar hai bhi toh kya?

ANIRUDH
We know everything about your past. Aapke offshore accounts and your association with Sleeper cells.

CALLEE
Your government agencies put those allegations against me. Investigation me kuch bhi nhi mila. Aap mujhe aise blackmail nhi kar paaoge.

ANIRUDH
And I also know everything about Outpost Two Twenty Five.

CALLEE
(Few seconds silence)
Sorry, come again?

ANIRUDH
I said mujhe Outpost Two Two Five ke baare me sab kuch pata hai.

CALLEE
(Again few seconds silence)
Hmm... Call me on my secure line. Note kijiye number-005172007.

Call disconnects. Anirudh is shaking a bit. He dials the number that callee gave him. Call connects.

ANIRUDH
Hello?

CALLEE
Hanji hello, iss line se connect karwane ka ek hi purpose hai, aapko batana ki there is a certain line you should not cross.

ANIRUDH
Aye! Dhamkane ki koshish kar rha hai tu mujhe?

CALLEE
Oh no not at all. Please enjoy the music I will be right back.

ANIRUDH
What?

Strange high pitched mechanical noise blurts from the speaker. Anirudh move the phone away from himself. Slowly brings it closer. The noise continues for sometime. Then stops.

ANIRUDH
Hello?

CALLEE
I hope you enjoyed the music.

ANIRUDH
Kya tha woh?

CALLEE
Nothing to worry about. Have a nice day.

Before Anirudh can say something call disconnects. He sinks his face into his hands and stays like that for a while.

Camera slowly pans and we can see that there is a shadow of a person sitting on the chair. Anirudh raises his head up and looks to his side. Notices the shadow. The shadow gets up and leaves to the right.

Anirudh is alarmed. He grabs his stick and mobile again and checks outside through the door. At a distance feet of a person is barely visible emerging near a wall turn at the end of the roof. It slowly pulls backwards.

Anirudh goes outside and checks around the roof. Sees absolutely nothing. Scratches his head and returns back to his room. Before returning to his workstation he secures the aldrop to lock the door. Then returns back to his workstation and this time he rotates his chair slightly to keep and eye on the door. 

Then starts calling people again. Next person is Shubhankar from Kolkata. He dials the number and call connects.

CALLEE
Hello, ke?

ANIRUDH
Hello, main Inspector Vijaya bol rha hu National Bureau of Investigation ke Cybercrime Division se. Kya meri baat Mr. Shubhankar se ho rhi hai?

CALLEE
(Speaks to someone else nearby)
NBI? Arre NBI theke bolche darao ektu.

ANIRUDH
Hello Shubhankar ji?

CALLEE
Ji ji bataiye.

ANIRUDH
Shubhankar ji mujhe ek case file pa assign kiya gaya hai jispe ki aapka naam saamne aaya hai. Hello?

Some commotion is audible on the other side.

CALLEE
(Speaks to someone else nearby)
Arre darao na, kotha bolchi karur shaathe.

ANIRUDH
Shubhankarji! Kya aap meri baat pe thoda focus karenge please?

CALLEE
(Speaks sternly)
Arre kaun Shubhankar? Mai Gopiraj bol rha hu. Aapko baat karni tha na mujhse?

ANIRUDH
Gopiraj? Meri Shubhankarji se baat ho rhi thi na? Ye kisko call lag gaya? Hello Shubhankarji?

CALLEE
(Voice slightly garbled)
Arre bhai sahab mai Gopiraj baat kar rha hu. Aapki baat hui thi mere bete se. Usne bataya ki bade battameez type ke aadmi ho tum.

Confused Anirudh drops the call abruptly. He checks the number again. The call log shows Shubhankar. 

ANIRUDH
Ye log toh Shubhankar hi dikha rha hai. Kisko call lag gaya?

He checks the number and dials again. Call connects.

CALLEE
Hello?

ANIRUDH
Hello? Shubhankarji?

CALLEE
Arre dada aapko mujhse baat karna hai ya Gopiraj ji se aap ye clear kijiiye na?

ANIRUDH
Kya? Gopiraj ji hain kya aapke saath wahan?

CALLEE
Arre nhi dada yahan koi Gopiraj naam ka nahi rehta yahi toh bata rha hu aapko kab se.

ANIRUDH
Accha koi baat nhi line mix ho gaya hoga, filhaal aap meri baat suniye dhyaan se. Aapke naam pe case register hua hai. Aapka naam aur Adhaar number linked hain Kolkata me kuch properties se jinko illegally khareeda gaya hai.

CALLEE
Kya aaltu faaltu baat kar rhe hain? Mere naam pe koi property nhi hai. Mai rented flat me rehta hu-with family.

ANIRUDH
Dekhiye Gopirajji-sorry, I mean Shubhankarji-

CALLEE
(Angrily, Garbled)
Arre mai Gopiraj hi bol rha hu! Mere bete se battameezi ki toh kaat dalunga tujhe isse-ye dekh-

At the corner of his eye just outside his window he notices a hand holding a small hatchet just outside his window. But the moment he looks at the hand it pulls backward.

Alarmed Anirudh drops his headphone, grabs his stick again and turns on flashlight. Looks outside the door slowly, fearfully. Again nothing. The call has been disconnected. He sits down on his chair and looks around confused.

ANIRUDH
Saala, kya ho rha hai ye mere saath?


#Act 3 - The Scam

INT. ROOFTOP ROOM - late night

Anirudh looks at the final entry in the Sheet. It says Anirudh G. He is shocked. He picks up his phone and calls his manager.

ANIRUDH
Hello sir.

SUPERVISOR
Hanji Anirudh bhai, kya hua?

ANIRUDH
Sir, ye mera naam list pe kyon hai?

SUPERVISOR
Han? Kya bol rhe ho? Tumhara naam kyon hoga list pe?

ANIRUDH
Sir, ispe Anirudh G likha hai and this looks like my number.

SUPERVISOR
Toh tum keh rhe ho poori duniya bus tum hi ek Anirudh G ho?

ANIRUDH
But sir, ye number...

SUPERVISOR
Bhai tumne Ganja phoonk liya hai kya? Kya ulta seedha bol rhe ho?

ANIRUDH
Nhi sir, pata nhi kya ho rha hai. But lag rha hai ye mera number.

SUPERVISOR
Abe phone kar aur dekh le na? Kya time kharab kar rha hai mera.a

ANIRUDH
Sir kuch theek nhi lag rha mujhe.

SUPERVISOR
Sun mere bhai, ek ehsaan kar mere upar. List khatam kar, aur report submit karde. Please, raat ke 11 baj rhe hain mujhse aur nhi ho rha.

ANIRUDH
Suniye toh sir, Kuch toh bohot ajeeb sa hi ho rha hai yahan.

SUPERVISOR
(Voice getting Garbled)
Anirudh list khatam kar de... List khatam kar de Anirudh...

ANIRUDH
Kya hua sir?

Call disconnects.

ANIRUDH
Hello? Hello?

Anirudh puts the phone down.

PHONE
(Garbled Voice)
List khatam kar...

ANIRUDH
What the fuck? Ye kya tha?

Scared, he looks around the room and the door. He gets up, picks up the door key and goes near the door. He tries opening but sees that the lock is on the other side of the door. He realizes he is trapped in the room.

ANIRUDH
Oh fuck. Kya karun, kya karun mai!

Anirudh picks up his phone and dials Emergency number. Someone picks up on the other side.

SUPERVISOR
Hello, Anirudh? Fir se kyon call kiya? Report daal di tune?

ANIRUDH
What? No sir! Maine aapko nhi call kiya! Mai toh... Mai toh... ye Emergency no pe call kiya.

SUPERVISOR
Are you out of your mind? Abe Emergency number kyon dial kar rha hai? Dimaag sahi me kharab ho gaya hai kya tumhara?

ANIRUDH
No Sir! Baat samajhiye. Mai apne hi room me band ho gaya hu sir. I need help, mujhe samajh me nhi aa rha hai kya karun.

SUPERVISOR
(Voice getting Garbled)
Maine kaha na List khatam karne ko... List khatam kar de Anirudh...

Anirudh hangs up. He grabs his head in distress. He slowly approaches his PC. Then opens the dialer and types in the number. Hesitantly presses Dial.

Silence hangs for 15-20 seconds. Then his personal phone starts ringing. Caller ID says Unknown Number. Anirudh slowly picks up.

ANIRUDH
Hel...Hello?

VOICE
(Same sound as Anirudh)
Hello, main Inspector Vijaya bol rha hu National Bureau of Investigation ke Cybercrime Division se. Kya meri baat Mr. Anirudh-ji se ho rhi hai?

ANIRUDH
(Panicking)
Kya? Kaun bol rha hai?

VOICE
Main Inspector Vijaya bol rha hu, mujhe assign kiya gaya hai ek case file me, jispe ki aapka naam saamne aaya hai...

ANIRUDH
Nhi nhi nhi. Ye nhi ho sakta. Kaise? Ye nhi ho sakta.

Anirudh drops his phone. Entities enter his room. Anirudh hides.

VOICE
Hello sir, meri awaaz aa rhi hai aapko? Hello?

Entities surround Anirudh, camera fades.

!FADE OUT